        "native_staggering": "All variables are cell-centered (longitude/latitude/pressure_level all 'center') — ERA5 is stored on a regular non-staggered grid. The model regrids the horizontal wind components u, v with B-spline interpolation and all centered scalars (including the vertical-velocity field w) conservatively (RFC §5.2); see era5.esm `regrid`.",
